          },
          {
            v: "3.4.1",
            d: "Mar 02, 2026",
            t: "Major streaming infrastructure update: added HLS support alongside existing Icecast streams with secure HTTPS proxy routing via stream.radioabf.com (abf-hd, abf-sd, abf-low naming unified). Migrated HLS to new channel-based backend paths. Added direct HTTP Icecast routes for compatibility (FLAC/MP3/AAC). Improved mobile performance and layout optimizations for smoother playback, faster loading, and enhanced responsiveness across devices."
          },
          {
            v: "3.4.0",
            d: "Feb 25, 2026",
